# V70: from first_recording's state, a second's wait, full gas straight on for 0.9 s (a hard launch
# that spins the rear; any longer and the bike reaches the drop ~30 ft ahead of the spawn), the brake
# (square) for 3 s to a stop, then gas with the brake and the bars full over to back up (P72) on an
# arc for 2.5 s, which leaves the bike beside its marks rather than on them, and the brake alone held for 6 s, for the chase camera to settle, and the shot (the spawn sits
# on the drop's lip, so a released bike rolls off it): shot.py releases the pad after the shot.
sleep 1000
down cross
sleep 900
release
down square
sleep 3000
down cross
stick l 1 0
sleep 2500
up cross
stick l 0 0
sleep 6000
